{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-blog-post-js","path":"/blog/how-to-start-a-podcast","result":{"data":{"post":{"title":"How to start a Podcast","caption":"\"Just do it\" - Nike","featuredImage":{"title":"Recording The Third Wheel Promo","description":"","fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":1.7621145374449338,"src":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4DEv0UW9jekK8QOj9v0OAp/12da6d6370ff44b18935331dc90691b2/image.png?w=3000&q=50","srcSet":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4DEv0UW9jekK8QOj9v0OAp/12da6d6370ff44b18935331dc90691b2/image.png?w=750&h=426&q=50 750w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4DEv0UW9jekK8QOj9v0OAp/12da6d6370ff44b18935331dc90691b2/image.png?w=1500&h=851&q=50 1500w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4DEv0UW9jekK8QOj9v0OAp/12da6d6370ff44b18935331dc90691b2/image.png?w=1600&h=908&q=50 1600w","srcWebp":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4DEv0UW9jekK8QOj9v0OAp/12da6d6370ff44b18935331dc90691b2/image.png?w=3000&q=50&fm=webp","srcSetWebp":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4DEv0UW9jekK8QOj9v0OAp/12da6d6370ff44b18935331dc90691b2/image.png?w=750&h=426&q=50&fm=webp 750w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4DEv0UW9jekK8QOj9v0OAp/12da6d6370ff44b18935331dc90691b2/image.png?w=1500&h=851&q=50&fm=webp 1500w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4DEv0UW9jekK8QOj9v0OAp/12da6d6370ff44b18935331dc90691b2/image.png?w=1600&h=908&q=50&fm=webp 1600w","sizes":"(max-width: 3000px) 100vw, 3000px"}},"date":"2020-02-26","id":"02dc05a5-a706-5d88-8dcf-8db79f9d3b07","content":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"So I'm going to skip out a lot of the basics like coming up with an idea, a name, identifying your target audience etc. in this post and focus a bit more on the technical stuff (because I think that's what people really want to know!).","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{"uri":"https://github.com/aaronconway7/my-website/blob/master/blog-content/how-to-start-a-podcast/index.md#equipment"},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"hyperlink"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Equipment","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"heading-2"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"So one of the most important things you need to identify at first is your budget (# of people on your podcast will affect this). Really you can start a podcast under any budget from just recording episodes using the microphone in your phone to splashing the cash on some of the professional gear. I've always seemed to find, not only in this case but with most instances when it comes to tech, as you spend more the less you get for your return (e.g. the difference in quality between an item that costs £10 and £100 is huge but the diffrence between an item that costs £500 and £1000 is not that much). Obviously this is a bit of a blanket statement and isn't factual in all cases but is a good general rule of thumb.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Below I'll list some of my recommendations from research from least to most expensive and highlight which ones we use on our Podcast in ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"value":"bold","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":". I won't go into detail for each item as there are probably much better resources for that but if there's something specific I've found i'll mention it!","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{"uri":"https://github.com/aaronconway7/my-website/blob/master/blog-content/how-to-start-a-podcast/index.md#microphone"},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"hyperlink"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Microphone","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"heading-3"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"You can get XLR and/or USB microphones. XLR microphones produce slightly better quality but you can reduce the equipment you need with a USB one.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Audio-Technica ATR2100 - ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"value":"USB and XLR","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"list-item"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{"uri":"https://amzn.to/37VtQwE"},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"RØDE Podmic","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"hyperlink"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"list-item"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{"uri":"https://amzn.to/36OCOeB"},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"value":"RØDE Procaster","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"hyperlink"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"list-item"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{"uri":"https://amzn.to/2wIiejw"},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Shure SM7B","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"hyperlink"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"list-item"}],"nodeType":"unordered-list"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{"uri":"https://github.com/aaronconway7/my-website/blob/master/blog-content/how-to-start-a-podcast/index.md#xlr-cable"},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"hyperlink"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"XLR Cable","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"heading-3"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{